OL,3,GNEWSAThieves hit shops and businesses
OL,4,Aon seafront
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves have broken into several
OL,7,Fseafront shops and businesses and
OL,8,Fstolen cash from tills and caused
OL,9,Fdamage.
OL,11,FSuffolk Police were called at 07:28 BST
OL,12,Fto reports that four businesses had
OL,13,Fbeen broken into in the Manning's
OL,14,FAmusement Park area on Sea Road,
OL,15,FFelixstowe.
OL,17,FThe offenders also attempted to break
OL,18,Finto two further businesses, including
OL,19,Fon Beach Street.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
